  <h4 class="fw-bold text-center mb-4">
    UNDER GRADUATE DIPLOMA IN COMPUTER APPLICATION<br>
    <small class="text-muted">3 Years Part Time Under Graduate Diploma Course - U.G.D.C.A.</small>
  </h4>

  <p class="mb-4">
    The course aims to create awareness among the students starting from the primary and preliminary knowledge to an advanced level of computers. This will enable an individual to work in today’s world of computer proficiency.
  </p>

  <h5 class="fw-bold">Eligibility Criterion:</h5>
  <p>
    This course runs parallel with graduation. Therefore, this course can be opted only by the first semester undergraduate students of Arya Mahila P.G. College Chetganj Varanasi.
  </p>

  <h5 class="fw-bold">Course Details:</h5>
  <p>
    Three years (6 semesters). Each semester has one theory and one practical paper.
  </p>

  <h5 class="fw-bold">Benefits of U.G.D.C.A.</h5>
  <ul class="list-group list-group-flush mb-4">
    <li class="list-group-item">A preamble to start the race in today’s digital world supported by the emblem of Banaras Hindu University.</li>
    <li class="list-group-item">A Part-time diploma that runs parallel with the graduation.</li>
    <li class="list-group-item">Invaluable diploma from Banaras Hindu University (B.H.U.).</li>
    <li class="list-group-item">Makes an individual computer savvy.</li>
    <li class="list-group-item">Nurtures an individual into a successful computer professional.</li>
    <li class="list-group-item">Candidate with little interest underlines his/her presence in any milieu of computers.</li>
  </ul>

  <h5 class="fw-bold">Syllabus</h5>
