                                    <h4 style="background: rgb(238, 238, 238); border: 1px solid rgb(204, 204, 204); padding: 5px 10px; text-align: center;"><span dir="rtl"><strong><a href="https://ampgc.ac.in/webpage/15b58df2-366b-4ca6-8d52-9b6c4a6a895a">Integrated Teacher Education Programme</a>&nbsp;(ITEP)</strong></span></h4>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p style="margin-left:9px; text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">Arya Mahila P. G. College offers (UG: B.A. B.Ed.) a four-year Integrated Teacher Education Programme (ITEP). </span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">About the program&mdash;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></b><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">B.A.B.Ed. is a four-year Integrated Teacher Education Programme (ITEP) designed for students aiming to build a career in teaching. It combines core Arts (Hindi, Sanskrit &amp; English) and Social Science&nbsp;&nbsp;(History, Political Science, </span></span></span><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">Economics &amp; Geography)</span>&nbsp;<span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:150%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">with professional teacher education in a single, well-structured course. By integrating both degrees, the programme reduces overall study time while ensuring strong academic depth and pedagogical expertise. Students gain hands-on teaching experiences through school internship, lesson planning, and classroom practice alongside theoretical learning which prepares graduates for career as secondary school teacher.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify">&nbsp;</p>

<p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">Eligibility for Admission:&nbsp;</span></span></span></b></span></span></span><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:107%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">Passed 10+2 or equivalent examination recognized by the Board/University, securing a minimum of 50% marks in the aggregate<b>.</b></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:200%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:200%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">Program Type:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Dual Degree&nbsp; Programme</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:200%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:200%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">Location:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Arya Mahila P. G. College, Varanasi</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:200%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:200%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">Total sanctioned seats:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;One (1) Unit: 50 seats</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:200%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:200%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">Duration:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;04 YEARS</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:200%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:200%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">Regular Seat Fee&nbsp;(In Rs.) : &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Rs. 50000/- (per annum)</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:200%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:200%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">Paid Seat Fee (In Rs.):&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Rs. 30000/- (per annum)&nbsp;+ Regular Seat Fee&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></b></span></span></span></p>

<p style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-size:11pt"><span style="line-height:200%"><span style="font-family:Calibri,&quot;sans-serif&quot;"><b><span style="font-size:12.0pt"><span style="line-height:200%"><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">**Admission process:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span>(</b><b><span style="font-family:&quot;Cambria&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;">Through &lsquo;CUET&rsquo; conducted by NTA</span>)</b></span></span></span></p>

